OL,3,AAttack victim's mum to seek justice for
OL,4,A'rest of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnaby's mum, Emma Webber, said: "The
OL,7,Frest of my life is going to be dealing
OL,8,Fwith this." The inquiry heard this week
OL,9,Fher son's death was "potentially
OL,10,Fpreventable".
OL,12,FDuring the inquiry that ended on
OL,13,FWednesday, counsel to the inquiry
OL,14,FRachel Langdale KC gave credit to the
OL,15,Ffamilies for bringing to light "one
OL,16,Ffailure after another".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
